  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.&nbsp;The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is _______</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1825",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The relation between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>nFE</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>(3 electrons are involved)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>(one electron is involved)</p><p>Hence, for</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>nFE</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math>(Four&nbsp;electrons&nbsp;are involved)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>825</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1825</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Electron exchange of that half cell reaction.</p></blockquote>",
